  "definition_ja": "数を掛け合わせる計算（かけ算）。結果を積という。",
  "definition_en": "The operation of multiplying numbers together; the answer is called the product.",
  "latex": "a \\times b = ab",
  "spoken_en": "a times b equals a b",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "Do the multiplication first: 2 plus 3 times 4 is 2 plus 12, so it's 14, not 20.",
      "ja": "かけ算を先にやろう。2 + 3 × 4 は 2 + 12 で 14。20 じゃないよ。",
      "register": "spoken"
