    {
      "en": "Decide the sign of the product before doing the multiplication, and then find the value of (−4) × (−6) × (−1).",
      "ja": "(−4) × (−6) × (−1) について、乗法を計算する前に積の符号を決め、その値を求めよ。",
      "register": "written"
